    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Warehouse Inventory Stocks-v1-spec",
    "description": "This API provides a comprehensive view of warehouse inventory stocks, enabling users to fetch detailed listings of available products and their quantities. Businesses can utilize this endpoint to monitor stock levels, assist in supply chain management, and enhance inventory planning. The API is essential for operations involving inventory checks, reporting, and analytics, making it a valuable resource for warehouse managers, logistics teams, and supply chain analysts. Typical use cases involve generating reports on stock availability or integrating inventory data into broader business systems.",
